a noisier channel than print and small group hyper focused conversation, so=
meone might think a bit about what redundancy devices (if any) Lojban has f=
or potentially confusing slots.  Since this day is unlikely to occur, this =
is merely a theoretical exercise, but at least we could say we have thought=
 of the matter the next time issue comes up (less often than once every fiv=
e years, I think, though no one seems to have been moved to action by the l=
ast couple of rounds either).

